text_01E6:
    string "モニター踏むなピピッ"                   ; en: Don't step on the monitor, pi-pip

text_01FB:
    string "番組打ち切りは無念だピピッ≦"               ; en: Getting my show canceled is a shame, pi-pip ≦

text_0218:
    string "プツン！！"                        ; en: Click!! (turns off)

text_0223:
    string "派手にＣＭを流そうピピッ♪"                ; en: Let's run flashy commercials, pi-pip ♪

text_023E:
    string "これで準備はバンタンさピピッ♪"              ; en: Now everything's ready, pi-pip ♪

text_025D:
    string "アドバルーンをあげて%K宣伝しようかなっピピッ★"     ; en: Maybe I'll put up an ad balloon / to advertise, pi-pip ★

text_028C:
    string "折り込みチラシで宣伝するピピッ"              ; en: I'll advertise with newspaper inserts, pi-pip

text_02AB:
    string "もうちょっと大きいといいかなピピッ"            ; en: Maybe a little bigger would be better, pi-pip

text_02CE:
    string "売り上げ倍増できるのかピピッ？"              ; en: Can I double the sales, pi-pip?

text_02ED:
    string "ピピッ今日は放送終わりマース"               ; en: Pi-pip, that's the end of today's broadcast

text_030A:
    string "入荷日は未定・・だピピッ♪"                ; en: Delivery date not set.. pi-pip ♪

text_0325:
    string "たまには休まないと壊れちゃうピピッ"            ; en: If I don't rest sometimes I'll break, pi-pip

text_0348:
    string "今のうちに買い占めるピピッ"                ; en: I'll buy it all up while I can, pi-pip

text_0363:
    string "電磁波防止グッズが欲しいピピッ★"             ; en: I want anti-electromagnetic-wave goods, pi-pip ★

text_0384:
    string "早くしないと売りきれちゃうピピッ≦"            ; en: If I don't hurry it'll sell out, pi-pip ≦

text_03A7:
    string "電磁波グッズは当店までーピピッ"              ; en: For electromagnetic goods, come to our store, pi-pip

text_03C6:
    string "移動式街頭テレビ%K%NMYはここにいるピピッ"      ; en: The mobile street TV, / <player>, is here, pi-pip

text_03EF:
    string "%NMYのお店は%K電磁波出まくりピピッ"         ; en: <player>'s store / is bursting with electromagnetic waves, pi-pip

text_0412:
    string "のらないピピッ♪"                     ; en: Not getting on, pi-pip ♪

text_0423:
    string "遠回りになるピピッ！"                   ; en: It's a detour, pi-pip!

text_0438:
    string "落語でも見てるピピッ♪"                  ; en: I'll watch some rakugo, pi-pip ♪

text_044F:
    string "なけなしの給料をおろしたピピッ"              ; en: I withdrew my meager pay, pi-pip

text_046E:
    string "これでビデオカメラ買うピピッ★"              ; en: I'll buy a video camera with this, pi-pip ★

text_048D:
    string "ピッ？%Kイッパイあると思ったのに≦"           ; en: Pip? / I thought there'd be lots ≦

text_04B0:
    string "%NMYただいま参上だピピッ"               ; en: <player> has just arrived, pi-pip

text_04C9:
    string "息苦しかったピピッ%K（一応息はしてるらしい）"      ; en: That was suffocating, pi-pip / (apparently it does breathe)

text_04F6:
    string "%NMYは%K荷物じゃないピピッ！！"           ; en: <player> is / not luggage, pi-pip!!

text_0515:
    string "悪いことデモしてるっピピッ？"               ; en: Are you up to something bad, pi-pip?

text_0532:
    string "★こんなお店も欲しいなピピッ"               ; en: ★ I'd like a store like this too, pi-pip

text_054F:
    string "ピピッ何々ここ？%K高そうなお店だピピッ？"        ; en: Pi-pip, what's this place? / Looks like a pricey store, pi-pip?

text_0578:
    string "この事は内緒にしとこうピピッ♪"              ; en: Let's keep this a secret, pi-pip ♪

text_0597:
    string "キャッシュバックって%Kうれしいピピッ♪"         ; en: Cash back / makes me happy, pi-pip ♪

text_05BE:
    string "ムチャクチャ得したっピピッ"                ; en: A crazy good deal, pi-pip

text_05D9:
    string "調子が悪いピピッ"                     ; en: Not feeling well, pi-pip

text_05EA:
    string "かなしいピッ♪"                      ; en: Sad, pip ♪

text_05F9:
    string "ピピッ？！"                        ; en: Pi-pip?!

text_0604:
    string "千里の道も一歩からだピピッ"                ; en: A journey of a thousand miles starts with one step, pi-pip

text_061F:
    string "オーナーはテレビ♪テレビ♪"                ; en: The owner is a TV ♪ a TV ♪

text_063A:
    string "ばっちり儲けてくれピピッ"                 ; en: Make lots of money for me, pi-pip

text_0653:
    string "ピッ？受信料払えなくなっちゃう"              ; en: Pip? I won't be able to pay the license fee

text_0672:
    string "画面が砂嵐みたいだピピッ≦"                ; en: The screen looks like snow, pi-pip ≦

text_068D:
    string "倹約しなくちゃだめっピピッ"                ; en: I have to economize, pi-pip

text_06A8:
    string "ピピッ♪%Kクリアビジョンにレベルアッープ！"       ; en: Pi-pip ♪ / Level up to Clear Vision!

text_06D3:
    string "ピピー！%K半分達成！記念放送ぉぉぉ☆"          ; en: Pi-peee! / Halfway reached! A commemorative broadcast ☆

text_06F8:
    string "もっと視聴率とんなきゃピピッ"               ; en: I need higher ratings, pi-pip

text_0715:
    string "どうしても売らなきゃダメピッ？"              ; en: Do I really have to sell, pip?

text_0734:
    string "・・・お別れだねピピッ"                  ; en: ...So it's goodbye, pi-pip

text_074B:
    string "ピピィィィ≦%Kもう少しまって欲しかったピピッ"      ; en: Pi-piiii ≦ / I wish you'd waited a little longer, pi-pip

text_0778:
    string "お店を開けないピピッ！！"                 ; en: I can't open a store, pi-pip!!

text_0791:
    string "ラララ♭ミュージーックショー♪%K（↑音楽番組を放送中）"  ; en: Lalala ♭ Music show ♪ / (↑ broadcasting a music program)

text_07C8:
    string "もっとイイトコ買ってやるピピッ"              ; en: I'll buy a better place, pi-pip

text_07E7:
    string "なんか買う気がおきないピピッ"               ; en: I don't feel like buying anything, pi-pip

text_0804:
    string "ここだと受信状態が悪いっピピッ"              ; en: Reception is bad here, pi-pip

text_0823:
    string "こんなのいらないピピッ"                  ; en: I don't need this, pi-pip

text_083A:
    string "ホロレチュチュパレロピピッ"                ; en: Horore-chuchupare-ro, pi-pip

text_0855:
    string "ピッピ！"                         ; en: Pip-pi!

text_085E:
    string "しゃべるテレビッピ"                    ; en: A talking TV, pip
    bytes 0x00, 0x00, 0x00    ; padding
